<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed mostly higher in active trading.</p>
<p>The Amex Composite index closed at 607.17, up 1.79.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.38.</p>
<p>Advancers beat decliners 312 to 217.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 20,854,320 compared with 24,651,215 on Friday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EST/2130 GMT)</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1881))</p>
</text>
